### Peticiones de ejemplo (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Obtener token como alice (rol USER)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "password": "alice123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Crear pedido (10 unidades -> descuento por volumen del 10%)
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "sku": "MOUSE-01", "quantity": 8 },
    { "sku": "MONITOR-27", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

###
@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.id}}

### 3. Consultar el pedido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Pagar el pedido (pasa por Retry + Circuit Breaker + Bulkhead)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Listar mis pedidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Token de administrador
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7. Traza de auditoría (Kafka -> DynamoDB), solo ADMIN
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Estado del circuit breaker de pagos
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/circuitbreakers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. Pedido de alto valor -> la pasarela simulada lo rechaza (422)
# @name bigOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "sku": "LAPTOP-14", "quantity": 5 } ] }

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{bigOrder.response.body.id}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Validación de entrada (400 con detalle por campo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "sku": "bad sku!", "quantity": 0 } ] }
